            "Pesticides targeting insects, applied by NYC agency-contracted exterminators or NYC agency pest control staff.",
            "NYC agency use of mosquito control",
            "Pesticides targeting mosquitoes, applied by NYC agency-contracted exterminators or NYC agency pest control staff. These application include treatment of standing water with larvicides and the spraying of adult mosquito infestations.",
